{"ID":"20240206091724-lgs50ys","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240206091724-lgs50ys","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091724-lgs50ys\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091732-x90fm3j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091727-955rsh9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091732-x90fm3j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:137,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:137\u0026#125;","title":"山慈菇（毛慈姑、杜鹃兰、冰球子）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902085436"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240712124629-lf9c2ww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712124629-lf9c2ww","updated":"20240830164927"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"杜鹃兰"}]},{"ID":"20240206091732-x90fm3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091732-x90fm3j","updated":"20240206091741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于贵州、四川等地。\n【性状】\t干燥的鳞茎，呈不规则扁球形或圆锥形，表面黄棕色至棕褐色。高约0.71.5cm，直径约0.51cm。底部圆而凹陷，有根痕，上端急尖，一侧有纵沟自基部伸向顶端。表面黄白色，光滑。质硬，略呈角质，横断面黄白色，粉质。气微，味淡，有黏性。\n【性味】\t甘、微辛，凉；有小毒。\n【功效】\t清热解毒，化痰散结。治咽喉肿痛，瘰疬，痈疽，疮肿，产后瘀滞。\n【注解】\t“玉带束腰”：指山慈菇药材中部有2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3条微突起的环节，如腰带状。\n【附注】\t杜鹃兰 (Cremastra appendiculata) 已被列入《濒危野生动植物种国际贸易公约》 (CITES) 附录二中。该物种虽可进行贸易，但须受许可证制度管制。"}]},{"ID":"20240206091727-955rsh9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091727-955rsh9","updated":"20240206091727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 612px;","style":"width: 602px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206091727-ei2gpjn.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 602px;\" parent-style=\"width: 612px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712114728-yuurzum","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712114728-yuurzum","updated":"20240712123122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 478px;","style":"width: 468px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"山慈菇 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/山慈菇 5-20240712114728-ux9h70f.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 468px;\" parent-style=\"width: 478px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712123902-9tu4x70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712123902-9tu4x70","updated":"20240712123909"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 480px;","style":"width: 470px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"杜鹃兰 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/杜鹃兰 8-20240712123902-tbhnd7u.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 470px;\" parent-style=\"width: 480px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 430px;","style":"width: 420px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"杜鹃兰 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/杜鹃兰 5-20240712123228-jbvn4wn.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 420px;\" parent-style=\"width: 430px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712115604-k1yr03c","Type":"NodeP